Provider icons in dnsmith/frontend/assets/logos/ are each provider's own
favicon, fetched from that provider's own website by tools/fetch_logos.py.
All product names, trademarks and registered trademarks in those files are
property of their respective owners. They are used here for identification
only - to show which service an entry updates - and imply no affiliation or
endorsement. The add-on renders initials for every provider whose icon is
absent, and works unchanged when none is present.

Provider names are the trademarks of their respective owners. They appear in
this repository to name the service an entry updates; no affiliation or
endorsement is implied.

What the provider manifests under dnsmith/providers/ and the modules under
dnsmith/hub/dnsmith_hub/adapters/providers/ record is factual: which host,
path and parameters a given provider's public API expects. They describe
third-party interfaces and contain no expression taken from any other project.
